message: "If you use KinematiK, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "KinematiK: prevalidation vehicle design studio for Formula Student and Formula Student EV"
authors:
  - family-names: Thio
    given-names: Frederik
license: AGPL-3.0-only
version: 1.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-22
doi: 10.5281/zenodo.23450788
repository-code: "https://github.com/frederikexd/kinematik"
url: "https://kinematik-ijzpvutb92x7n3yzo7sdqc.streamlit.app/"
abstract: >-
  Open-source design tools for Formula SAE and Formula SAE EV teams. KinematiK derives suspension targets from
  vehicle requirements and synthesises double-wishbone hardpoints to meet them inside absolute packaging,
  structural and steering walls, prices each candidate for build yield, and records every search as a hashed,
  re-runnable manifest. It also covers vehicle dynamics, aerodynamics, brakes, powertrain and energy, thermal,
  electrical systems, data acquisition and measurement.
keywords:
  - Formula SAE
  - suspension kinematics
  - inverse kinematics
  - vehicle dynamics
  - reproducibility
